# The Gobbiebag Part VI (jeuno 75): Lower Jeuno's Bluffnix (no script; default 43 with 81), the template GobbiebagQuest.
# A level 75 Warrior at Jeuno fame level 3 ((250 + 0 + 0) / 2 = 125), the inventory at 55 (storage; a fresh char has
# 30), Parts I-V completed (the chain's earlier parts, by a GM), the four items, a Bowl of Goblin Stew (880) and a
# Chocobo Feather. Available: a trade: no trade handler; 43 (56, 0, 1), option 1: nothing; option 0: begun. Accepted: 43
# (56, 1, 1), its finish: no handler; three items, the four and the feather, the stew and an item: 43 (56, 1, 1); the
# stew alone: 73 (61), the quest completed by a GM while it is open: no 73 finish (the stew kept); accepted again (a
# GM): the four items: 73 (61), finished: completed, the inventory 60, INVENTORY_INCREASED, the items taken (no satchel:
# unchanged). Completed: no section; Bluffnix's default 43 (81) (Part VII wants fame level 4). Set accepted by a GM at
# 60: the accepted check fails: no section (43 (81)), a trade: nothing; set available by a GM at 60: no section. A GM
# sets a part available before accepted (accepted over completed keeps it completed).
lists LowerJeuno/Bluffnix/onTrigger LowerJeuno/Bluffnix/onTrade LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/43 LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/73
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=-41.7,5.9,-113 job=WAR lvl=75
storage inventory 55                    # the part's start size (char_storage.inventory; a fresh char has 30)
fame Sandoria 250
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartI completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIi completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIii completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIv completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartV completed
item ShakudoIngot
item SquareOfBallonCloth
item Iolite
item HighQualityEftSkin
item BowlOfGoblinStew880
item ChocoboFeather
login
trade Bluffnix ChocoboFeather x1        # available: no trade handler; nothing
trigger Bluffnix                        # reqsMet: 43 (56, 0, 1)
finish option=1                         # not 0: nothing
trigger Bluffnix                        # 43 (56, 0, 1)
finish option=0                         # begun
trigger Bluffnix                        # accepted: 43 (56, 1, 1)
finish option=0                         # no 43 finish while accepted: nothing
trade Bluffnix ShakudoIngot x1 SquareOfBallonCloth x1 Iolite x1 # three of the four: 43 (56, 1, 1)
finish
trade Bluffnix ShakudoIngot x1 SquareOfBallonCloth x1 Iolite x1 HighQualityEftSkin x1 ChocoboFeather x1 # an extra item: 43 (56, 1, 1)
finish
trade Bluffnix BowlOfGoblinStew880 x1 ShakudoIngot x1 # the stew and an item: 43 (56, 1, 1)
finish
trade Bluffnix BowlOfGoblinStew880 x1   # the stew alone: 73 (61)
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartVi completed # a GM, while 73 is open
finish                                  # no 73 finish while completed: nothing (the stew kept)
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartVi available # a GM: accepted over completed keeps it completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartVi accepted # a GM
trade Bluffnix ShakudoIngot x1 SquareOfBallonCloth x1 Iolite x1 HighQualityEftSkin x1 # the four items: 73 (61)
finish                                  # completed; inventory 60; INVENTORY_INCREASED; the items taken
trigger Bluffnix                        # completed: no section; 43 (81)
finish option=1                         # declined: nothing
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartVi available # a GM: accepted over completed keeps it completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartVi accepted # a GM, at 60
trigger Bluffnix                        # accepted, the inventory 60: no section; 43 (81)
finish
trade Bluffnix BowlOfGoblinStew880 x1   # no section: nothing
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartVi available # a GM, at 60
trigger Bluffnix                        # available, the inventory 60: no section; 43 (81)
finish option=0                         # no section: not begun
